  "title": "Three resistors in series",
  "level": "university",
  "source": {
    "type": "problem",
    "text": "An ideal 9.0 V battery is connected to three resistors in series: R1 = 100 ohm, R2 = 200 ohm and R3 = 300 ohm. Find the current in the circuit and the voltage across R2."
  },
  "steps": [
